{"id":"nd769dde956","headline":"European Nations, Japan Say Ready To Help Secure Passage Through Strait Of Hormuz","summary":"The US, European allies and Japan said they are ready for appropriate efforts to secure passage through the Strait of Hormuz. Three countries said any effort would occur only after a ceasefire.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of global oil and gas shipments, so naval security arrangements there matter for energy markets. Coordinated allied action would shape shipping risk and insurance costs.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Strait of Hormuz","country":"Oman","lat":26.56,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"RadioFreeEurope/RadioLiberty","url":"https://www.rferl.org/a/israel-iran-war-caspitan-energy-oil-attacks/33710118.html"},"sources":[{"name":"RadioFreeEurope/RadioLiberty","url":"https://www.rferl.org/a/israel-iran-war-caspitan-energy-oil-attacks/33710118.html"}],"published_at":"2026-03-18T23:21:39Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"a06c89e87e223fe7","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-18T23:21:39Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AE","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-5957064.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"angad305","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/ship-sea-horizon-sky-blue-sky-5957064/"}}